  "statement": "# DYNAMO — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nTraverse a compact pixel-art platforming space where movement powers a resource that enables a distinctive world-changing traversal verb.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA short multi-beat 2D puzzle-platformer with readable movement rules, at least one mechanic beyond ordinary run/jump, failure recovery, and full-game completion.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may decide the exact resource rule, room topology, optional pickups, and difficulty curve as long as the special verb matters to the clear.\n"
